Thanks Greg! This seems to work for us (Diego Pacheco ran it, and the neuropil .obj files look good) -

for(n in FAFB14NP.surf$RegionList) {
  open3d()
  shade3d(as.mesh3d(subset(FAFB14NP.surf, n)))
  writeOBJ(paste0(n, "FAFB.obj"))
}

